{
  "format": 1,
  "name": "bds_placing_buildings",
  "spec": ["building-development 4.9", "building-development 4.9.1"],
  "description": "Placing buildings, by hand from 4.9 and 4.9.1 (DG5) (cell width 16, terrain altitude 300, area altitude 250; created occupants take IDs from 500 and start with the constructor's empty box; type 0x100's exemplar has the occupant size 0x27812810 = (16, 10, 8), type 0x102's has none). LocationIsOKForNewBuilding: unknown type -> false; a building occupant at the cell containing (x, z) -> false; else true. AddNewBuildingOccupant(type, pos, orientation): unknown type or occupied cell -> null with no host call. (0x100, {40, -1, 56}, 1): create (GZCOM's reference, not AddRef'd again), set type, the loader 0x00698490 (the type's exemplar becomes the default exemplar, then the box (0, 0, 0)-(16, 10, 8) from 0x27812810), the box's x and z extents swapped for orientation 1 ((0, 0, 0)-(8, 10, 16)) and stored, y < 0 -> GetLowestOrHighestAreaAltitude over the box's own local rectangle {0, 0, 8, 16} [quirk] = 250, position (40, 250, 56), orientation 1, init, insert; the BDS releases its creation reference after the insert, so the occupant manager holds the only one. y = -0.0 is not < 0 (no area altitude); orientation 2 keeps the box; orientation 3 swaps. An exemplar without 0x27812810 leaves the empty box. The loader is true on every path (DG5): an exemplar that does not load leaves the empty box and no default exemplar, and the building is still inserted and returned. Insert failure or no occupant manager -> released, null ([inferred]: the original returns the occupant only through a successful insert). The cell overload (0x100, cell (3, 4), 0) -> position (56, 300, 72) with the terrain altitude at the cell centre. PlopBuilding(profile: type 0x100, cell (5, 6), orientation 3, land value max 200) -> the cell overload with the profile's orientation (+0x18, §4.9 and spec test 17), not the land value max. AddNewBuildingOccupant(occupant) inserts it; DemolishFoundationOccupant removes it; GetCostOfOccupantDemolition(building) = int64 property 0x099AFACD or 0; the foundation overload is 0.",
  "steps": [
    {"op": "bds_process", "seed": 1},
    {"op": "bds_world", "altitude": 300, "area_altitude": 250},
    {"op": "bds_exemplars", "list": [{"building": "0x100", "purpose": 1, "wealth": 1, "size": [16, 10, 8]}, {"building": "0x102", "purpose": 1, "wealth": 1}]},
    {"op": "bds_create"},
    {"op": "bds_init", "expect": true},
    {"op": "bds_occupants", "list": [{"id": 0, "bbox": [[0, 0, 0], [0, 0, 0]]}], "building_cells": [[2, 2]]},
    {"op": "bds_world", "next_token": 500},
    {"op": "bds_clear_events"},

    {"op": "bds_call", "method": "location_ok", "args": ["0x100", 40, 40], "expect": false},
    {"op": "bds_call", "method": "location_ok", "args": ["0x100", 48, 40], "expect": true},
    {"op": "bds_call", "method": "location_ok", "args": ["0x101", 48, 40], "expect": false},
    {"op": "bds_call", "method": "add_occupant", "args": ["0x101", [48, 0, 40], 0], "expect": null},
    {"op": "bds_call", "method": "add_occupant", "args": ["0x100", [40, 0, 40], 0], "expect": null},
    {"op": "bds_expect_events", "events": []},

    {"op": "bds_call", "method": "add_occupant", "args": ["0x100", [40, -1, 56], 1], "expect": 500},
    {"op": "bds_expect_events", "events": [
      {"event": "create_occupant", "occ": 500},
      {"event": "set_building_type", "occ": 500, "type": "0x100"},
      {"event": "set_default_exemplar", "occ": 500, "key": ["0x6534284A", "0x10000000", "0x100"], "result": true},
      {"event": "set_bbox", "occ": 500, "min": [0, 0, 0], "max": [16, 10, 8]},
      {"event": "set_bbox", "occ": 500, "min": [0, 0, 0], "max": [8, 10, 16]},
      {"event": "area_altitude", "rect": [0, 0, 8, 16]},
      {"event": "set_position", "occ": 500, "pos": [40, 250, 56]},
      {"event": "set_orientation", "occ": 500, "orientation": 1},
      {"event": "init_occupant", "occ": 500},
      {"event": "insert_occupant", "occ": 500, "result": true},
      {"event": "release", "occ": 500}]},
    {"op": "bds_expect_refs", "occupants": {"500": 1}},
    {"op": "bds_clear_events"},
    {"op": "bds_call", "method": "add_occupant", "args": ["0x100", [40, -0.0, 56], 2], "expect": 501},
    {"op": "bds_expect_event_count", "filter": {"event": "area_altitude"}, "count": 0},
    {"op": "bds_expect_events", "filter": {"event": "set_bbox"}, "events": [{"min": [0, 0, 0], "max": [16, 10, 8]}, {"min": [0, 0, 0], "max": [16, 10, 8]}]},
    {"op": "bds_clear_events"},
    {"op": "bds_call", "method": "add_occupant", "args": ["0x100", [40, 5, 56], 3], "expect": 502},
    {"op": "bds_expect_event_count", "filter": {"event": "set_position", "pos": [40, 5, 56]}, "count": 1},
    {"op": "bds_expect_events", "filter": {"event": "set_bbox"}, "events": [{"min": [0, 0, 0], "max": [16, 10, 8]}, {"min": [0, 0, 0], "max": [8, 10, 16]}]},

    {"op": "bds_clear_events"},
    {"op": "bds_call", "method": "add_occupant", "args": ["0x102", [40, 5, 56], 1], "expect": 503},
    {"op": "bds_expect_events", "filter": {"occ": 503}, "events": [
      {"event": "create_occupant"},
      {"event": "set_building_type", "type": "0x102"},
      {"event": "set_default_exemplar", "key": ["0x6534284A", "0x10000000", "0x102"], "result": true},
      {"event": "set_bbox", "min": [0, 0, 0], "max": [0, 0, 0]},
      {"event": "set_position", "pos": [40, 5, 56]},
      {"event": "set_orientation", "orientation": 1},
      {"event": "init_occupant"},
      {"event": "insert_occupant", "result": true},
      {"event": "release"}]},

    {"op": "bds_occupants", "list": [{"id": 0, "resource_fails": true}]},
    {"op": "bds_world", "next_token": 520},
    {"op": "bds_clear_events"},
    {"op": "bds_call", "method": "add_occupant", "args": ["0x100", [40, 5, 56], 0], "expect": 520},
    {"op": "bds_expect_events", "events": [
      {"event": "create_occupant", "occ": 520},
      {"event": "set_building_type", "occ": 520, "type": "0x100"},
      {"event": "set_default_exemplar", "occ": 520, "result": false},
      {"event": "set_bbox", "occ": 520, "min": [0, 0, 0], "max": [0, 0, 0]},
      {"event": "set_position", "occ": 520, "pos": [40, 5, 56]},
      {"event": "set_orientation", "occ": 520, "orientation": 0},
      {"event": "init_occupant", "occ": 520},
      {"event": "insert_occupant", "occ": 520, "result": true},
      {"event": "release", "occ": 520}]},
    {"op": "bds_expect_refs", "occupants": {"520": 1}},
    {"op": "bds_occupants", "list": [{"id": 0, "resource_fails": false}]},
    {"op": "bds_world", "next_token": 504},
    {"op": "bds_world", "insert_ok": false},
    {"op": "bds_clear_events"},
    {"op": "bds_call", "method": "add_occupant", "args": ["0x100", [40, 5, 56], 0], "expect": null},
    {"op": "bds_expect_events", "filter": {"event": "insert_occupant"}, "events": [{"occ": 504, "result": false}]},
    {"op": "bds_expect_refs", "occupants": {"504": 0}},
    {"op": "bds_world", "insert_ok": true, "occupant_manager": false},
    {"op": "bds_clear_events"},
    {"op": "bds_call", "method": "add_occupant", "args": ["0x100", [40, 5, 56], 0], "expect": null},
    {"op": "bds_expect_event_count", "filter": {"event": "insert_occupant"}, "count": 0},
    {"op": "bds_expect_events", "filter": {"event": "release"}, "events": [{"occ": 505}]},
    {"op": "bds_call", "method": "insert_occupant", "args": [77], "expect": false},
    {"op": "bds_world", "occupant_manager": true},

    {"op": "bds_clear_events"},
    {"op": "bds_call", "method": "add_occupant_at_cell", "args": ["0x100", 3, 4, 0], "expect": 506},
    {"op": "bds_expect_events", "filter": {"event": "set_position"}, "events": [{"occ": 506, "pos": [56, 300, 72]}]},
    {"op": "bds_call", "method": "add_occupant_at_cell", "args": ["0x100", 2, 2, 0], "expect": null},
    {"op": "bds_clear_events"},
    {"op": "bds_call", "method": "plop", "args": [{"type": "0x100", "x": 5, "z": 6, "orientation": 3, "lv_max": 200, "zone": 1, "wealth": 1, "purpose": 1}], "expect": 507},
    {"op": "bds_expect_event_count", "filter": {"event": "set_position", "occ": 507, "pos": [88, 300, 104]}, "count": 1},
    {"op": "bds_expect_events", "filter": {"event": "set_orientation"}, "events": [{"occ": 507, "orientation": 3}]},
    {"op": "bds_call", "method": "plop", "args": [{"type": "0x101", "x": 5, "z": 6}], "expect": null},

    {"op": "bds_clear_events"},
    {"op": "bds_call", "method": "insert_occupant", "args": [77], "expect": true},
    {"op": "bds_call", "method": "demolish_foundation", "args": [77], "expect": true},
    {"op": "bds_expect_events", "events": [
      {"event": "insert_occupant", "occ": 77, "result": true},
      {"event": "remove_occupant", "occ": 77}]},
    {"op": "bds_occupants", "list": [{"id": 78, "cost": -1234567890123}]},
    {"op": "bds_call", "method": "demolition_cost", "args": [78], "expect": -1234567890123},
    {"op": "bds_call", "method": "demolition_cost", "args": [79], "expect": 0},
    {"op": "bds_call", "method": "foundation_cost", "args": [78], "expect": 0}
  ]
}
